  "description": "Caching integration library for Vali-Mediator (.NET 7/8/9).\n            Provides a pluggable ICacheStore abstraction, an in-memory implementation with expiry\n            and group-based invalidation, and two pipeline behaviors: CachingBehavior (read-through /\n            write-through) and CacheInvalidationBehavior.\n            Zero external dependencies beyond Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions\n            and Vali-Mediator.",
  "iconFile": "logo.png",
